  "description": "This YITAMOTOR mirror was engineered to look, fit and function like the original mirror assembly for your vehicle's specific year, make, and model. Upgrade to our high-quality towing mirror today and enjoy a safer, more enjoyable driving experience.\nFitment\nFor 88-99 Chevy GMC C1500/K1500\nFor 88-00 Chevy GMC C2500/C3500/K2500/K3500\nFor 92-99 Chevy GMC C1500 Suburban/C2500 Suburban\nFor 92-99 Chevy GMC K1500 Suburban/K2500 Suburban\nFor 95-99 Chevy Tahoe (ONLY FIT 2000 Tahoe Z71 4pin, 8pin is not applicable)\nFor 1992-2000 GMC Yukon\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nDual Glass Design\nThese towing mirrors are with power-adjusted upper plane glass and manually adjusted blind-spot convex mirrors, providing you with a better and wider rear view.\nHeated Upper Plane Glass\nThe upper plane glass of these mirrors is heated for defogging and defrosting. It can defog and defrost by itself, super convenient for you on a rainy or foggy day.\nDurable and Safe\nMade from high-quality materials, our rearview mirror is durable and built to withstand impacts and resist shattering, providing added safety in the event of an accident.\nManual Telescoping Function\nThese mirrors can be manually extended so you can have a wider and better rear view. You can also fold them in tight places.\nAluminum Triangle Base\nThese tow mirrors can be stably installed on your vehicle as they adopt classic triangle construction, durable aluminum base, and pre-installed studs.",
